\par
\emph{All regulations are authorized by statutes passed by the Congress and regulatory agencies may}
\par
\emph{not go beyond their statutory authority. This paper is not intended to provide legal advice and it}
\par
\emph{is strongly suggested that if you suspect one of these problems may be an issue with the}
\par
\emph{regulation you are addressing, you should contact an attorney who specializes in regulatory law.}
\par
C.1. The regulation goes outside of the agency`s mission. extend their legislative authority well beyond the intent of Congress. regulations are overturned in courts.xxxv
\par
In many cases, the agency will push or
