\par
essential mediator role in the relationship between IT
\par
infrastructure capabilities and IT project success. We state
\par
this mediating relationship as three hypotheses below.
\par
Since IT infrastructure capabilities have different compo-
\par
nents, hypotheses H1 and H2 are further broken into H1a,
\par
H1b, and H2a--H2c, respectively.
\par
