\par
\textbf{semantics}
\par
based on the definitions and heuristics methods that per-
\par
form similarity calculations according to the composi-
\par
tion, inheritance, and attribute similarities.
\par
d \emph{Instantiation of matching target product data semantic}
\par
\emph{concepts}. Use of these mapping methods and source
\par
product data semantics to dynamically generate matching
\par
target product data based on target knowledge
\par
representation.
\par
Each of these four key elements is described in more detail in
